## Scope

This repo is **pharmacy-erp-desktop**. Backend rules apply to `backend/` (NestJS + Prisma + TypeScript). Architecture docs live under `docs/pharmacy_erp_architecture_docs/`.

**Standard:** Follow the scoped `.mdc` rules in `.cursor/rules/` for all backend work unless the user overrides a specific rule in the task.

---

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Runtime | Node.js |
| Framework | NestJS 11 |
| Language | TypeScript 5.7 |
| ORM | Prisma 7 (`@prisma/adapter-better-sqlite3`) |
| Database | SQLite (`db/pharmacy.sqlite`) |
| Validation | class-validator + class-transformer |
| Testing | Jest 30 |
| Lint / format | ESLint 9 (`typescript-eslint` type-checked) + Prettier |

---

## Repository layout

```
backend/
  src/
    common/          # exceptions, interceptors, response types
    persistence/     # UnitOfWork, Outbox, Sequence, InventoryLedger, RequestContext
    prisma.service.ts
    prisma.module.ts
    app.module.ts
    main.ts
  seed/              # deterministic seed data + generators
  test/
    persistence/     # integration tests against seeded SQLite
docs/pharmacy_erp_architecture_docs/
  database/          # schema docs, persistence-patterns.md
db/
  pharmacy.sqlite
```

---

## Key commands

Run from `backend/`:

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run start:dev` | Dev server with watch |
| `npm run build` | Compile NestJS |
| `npm run lint` | ESLint (auto-fix) |
| `npm run format` | Prettier write |
| `npm run test` | Unit tests (`src/**/*.spec.ts`) |
| `npm run test:persistence` | Persistence integration tests (`--runInBand`) |
| `npm run test:e2e` | End-to-end tests |
| `npm run db:seed` | Seed database |
| `npm run db:seed:fresh` | Wipe + seed |
| `npm run db:reset` | Force-reset schema + fresh seed |

Before finishing backend changes, run `npm run lint` and relevant tests.

